# Application Data Source Mode:
# Live data is the default: playlists, tracks and search read from Supabase / Spotify.
# Set to 'demo' ONLY for an explicit offline fixture preview (no data is persisted).
VITE_DATA_SOURCE=supabase

# Spotify Web API Integration (PKCE OAuth Flow)
# Provide your Spotify Client ID from https://developer.spotify.com/dashboard.
# PKCE does not require a client secret in the browser.
# SECURITY NOTE: Never use VITE_CLIENT_SECRET_SPOTIFY or expose CLIENT_SECRET to browser code.
VITE_SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=your_spotify_client_id_here
# `CLIENT_ID_SPOTIFY` is also accepted (exposed to the browser via envPrefix in vite.config.ts).
# CLIENT_SECRET_SPOTIFY=your_server_only_secret_here (Server-only, optional, never expose to Vite)
